# Notification Center: panel at the right under the bar (x≈1530..1912 Material, 1544..1912 Glass); read rows from the first shot
look glass
wait 2
setup gdbus call --session --dest org.freedesktop.Notifications --object-path /org/freedesktop/Notifications --method org.freedesktop.Notifications.Notify Chat 0 '' 'Ann' 'Lunch?' "['inline-reply','Reply']" '{}' 0
wait 0.5
ipc panels open notificationCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot nc
note click Reply on the card (from shot)
key hello -k Return
wait 0.5
shot sent
note 'Sent'
wait 2.7
shot reply-back
note the Reply button is back
key -k Escape
wait 0.5
shot closed
note NC closed
